his word is positively associated with university ranking, such that higher-ranked institutions are more likely to publish papers containing <span  \"><i>\"odi\" </i></span> (<span style=\"color: rgba(170, 117, 250, 1.0); font-weight: bold;\">91<sup>st</sup></span> percentile). "}